# Shopping Mall Nine (a department store on a long road, bright all day): a bouncy marimba tune in G major over a bell, a pizzicato
# answer, a springy bass and a shuffling beat. It plays the same by day and by night. Original composition for this game (plan 22 ·
# U8, part a).
